wip/f3d: Import f3d-4.0.1

F3D is a fast and minimalist 3D viewer built on VTK, with the f3d
application, the libf3d library and Python bindings.  Built with the
ImGui, OpenEXR and WebP modules and the Alembic, Assimp, Draco, HDF
(Exodus/VTKHDF), OpenCASCADE and USD (wip/openusd) plugins; the VDB
plugin needs VTK's IOOpenVDB module, which graphics/vtk lacks.  Plain
Unix layout instead of a macOS app bundle; rendering uses OpenGL 4.1
on Metal.
